      "jp": "周りを警戒しながら、森を慎重に進んでいく。すると――。",
      "jp_sha256": "cc8b541dd89820491a2a1bfc30ba5b169ab3531ceb14e72993ebd65278db6dbd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "주위를 경계하며 조심스럽게 숲을 나아갔다. 그러자――.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
